 indeed those uh  who voted uh to stay within the european  union do they still have the same views  some have said yes and some have said  they didn't realize the impact it would  maybe have  and and  yeah it's just a case of let's see what  happens but at the moment  people really don't realize how hard it  is for every single industry out there  at the moment everyone is working so  hard there is no staff anywhere  and it's really really hard at the  moment  okay keep your head up kate thanks very  much  thank you  thanks a lot my next guest went from  working in factories and sleeping in  cars  to become the first and only ufc world  champion while fighting with one eye  as well as his world champion title  michael bisping has also starred in  hollywood blockbusters and penned a  best-selling book and now he's going on  tour across the uk pleased to say that  michael is with us now live i think from  hello hello to you mike from la i should  say hello to michael thanks for joining  us on the program you were inducted i  believe into the ufc hall of fame back  in 2019 did you ever imagine when you  started that that's where you would find  yourself  never in a million years and a pleasure  to speak to you okay yeah it's been  quite a long goal journey and there you  summed it up pretty well though you know  working in the factories sleeping in my  car and of course as you mentioned  losing an eye along the way and yeah i  never thought it would come to this but  uh here we are it's almost midnight here  in los angeles but i'm uh i just got out  of bed actually i set my alarm it's it  sounds very very rock and roll but uh  i'm old these days i got three kids i  went to bed i set my alarm and it's a  pleasure to talk to you well you look  fantastic i wish i looked like that when  i just woken up um talk to me about how  you lost your eye  well listen you know i mean the sport i  take part in it's uh you know it's a  beautiful sport but it's also very  vicious and of course it's mixed martial  arts so you know you can punch kick knee  and elbow and unfortunately i got kicked  in the head of a guy down in brazil  called vito belfort who uh was on every  performance enhancing drug under the sun  and sadly that caused my retina to  detach i got it fixed it redetached so  on and so forth six surgeries later and  sadly yeah you know i've got one eye but  still in the land of the blind the  one-eyed man is king that's what they  say but how challenging does it make you  fighting when you've only got one eye  because it must be such a big difference  that you have to get used to  yeah just a little bit you know people  always say to me how did you fight with  one eye and i always say with great  difficulty you know obviously the depth  perception is way off in fact it's  non-existent so it was very very  difficult but uh fortunately i had some  very patient coaches and uh you know we  managed to get the job done the thing  was the hardest part was keeping it  secret this whole time because obviously  you know uh getting licensed with one  eye isn't very very easy so uh i'd sell  a few porcupies along the way but still  i'm retired now so now i can start  telling the truth  and now you can tell some stories on  tour tell us about that  yeah that's right yeah so i did a  one-man show a couple of years ago in  toronto and uh if you've ever seen the  mike tyson one-man show on disputed  truth i guess it's something like that  however i didn't squander 400 million  dollars or go to prison for rape so uh  it's not too similar i guess in that  regard but still yeah so i did it in  toronto and uh everyone really enjoyed  it it was a real good laugh and then  some promoters that i got talking to you  know they  they came to me with an offer and i'm  doing a mini tour throughout the uk and  the support was so great that's actually  i'm coming back next year we're doing uh  way more dates in england we're doing  mainland europe we're doing aust